  data: {
    LLM: "As a Commoner, never trust a 'helpful' pass. If someone passes on the Emperor's 7, they might be the Eunuch saving their high cards for later.\n\nThe Lead Tactic: If you are the Emperor with many 6s (the lowest card), lead them in big sets (e.g., 'Six 6s') early. This forces the Commoners to break up their strong sets to stop you.\n\nEunuch Camouflage: The Eunuch should intentionally play a moderately high card against the Emperor early to verify their 'loyalty' to the Commoners, then switch sides at the most damaging moment.",
    Player: "As a Commoner, never trust a 'helpful' pass. If someone passes on the Emperor's 7, they might be the Eunuch saving their high cards for later.\n\nThe Lead Tactic: If you are the Emperor with many 6s (the lowest card), lead them in big sets (e.g., 'Six 6s') early. This forces the Commoners to break up their strong sets to stop you.\n\nEunuch Camouflage: The Eunuch should intentionally play a moderately high card against the Emperor early to verify their 'loyalty' to the Commoners, then switch sides at the most damaging moment.",
